#: src/settings.ts
msgid "Search & Replace i18n"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings.ts
msgid "GUI Preference"
msgstr "介面偏好"

#: src/settings.ts
msgid "If you don't like the panel, you can switch to a popup dialog instead."
msgstr "如果您不喜歡面板，可以改用彈出對話方塊。"

#: src/settings.ts
msgid "Open a panel (default, recommended)"
msgstr "開啟面板（預設，建議）"

#: src/settings.ts
msgid "Open a dialog (like in previous versions)"
msgstr "開啟對話方塊（與舊版本相同）"

#: src/index.ts src/panel.ts src/dialog.ts
msgid "Search and replace"
msgstr "尋找與取代"

#: src/index.ts
msgid "Find previous"
msgstr "尋找上一個"

#: src/index.ts
msgid "Find next"
msgstr "尋找下一個"

#: src/index.ts src/panel.ts src/dialog.ts
msgid "Replace"
msgstr "取代"

#: src/index.ts src/panel.ts
msgid "Replace all"
msgstr "全部取代"

#: src/panel.ts
msgid "Close"
msgstr "關閉"

#: src/panel.ts
msgid "Please return to the markdown editor."
msgstr "請返回 Markdown 編輯器。"

#: src/panel.ts src/dialog.ts
msgid "Find"
msgstr "尋找"

#: src/panel.ts
msgid "Previous"
msgstr "上一個"

#: src/panel.ts
msgid "Next"
msgstr "下一個"

#: src/panel.ts
msgid "(all)"
msgstr "（全部）"

#: src/panel.ts
msgid "Regex:"
msgstr "規則運算式："

#: src/panel.ts src/dialog.ts
msgid "Options:"
msgstr "選項："

#: src/panel.ts src/dialog.ts
msgid "Wrap around"
msgstr "循環尋找"

#: src/panel.ts src/dialog.ts
msgid "Match case"
msgstr "大小寫須相符"

#: src/panel.ts src/dialog.ts
msgid "Match whole words only"
msgstr "全字拼寫須相符"

#: src/panel.ts src/dialog.ts
msgid "Preserve case"
msgstr "保留大小寫"

#: src/panel.ts src/dialog.ts
msgid "Use 'multi line' flag"
msgstr "使用「多行」旗標"

#: src/panel.ts src/dialog.ts
msgid "Literal search"
msgstr "一般尋找"

#: src/panel.ts src/dialog.ts
msgid "Use Wildcards"
msgstr "使用萬用字元"

#: src/panel.ts src/dialog.ts
msgid "Use Regular Expression"
msgstr "使用規則運算式"

#: src/panel.ts
msgid "Show help"
msgstr "顯示說明"

#: src/panel.ts
msgid "When you reach the end of the note, it will wrap around to the beginning of the note (and vice versa)."
msgstr "到達筆記結尾時，會從筆記開頭繼續尋找（反之亦然）。"

#: src/panel.ts
msgid "With wildcards enabled, you can search using <code>?</code> (any <b>one</b> character) and <code>*</code> (any characters, zero or more). Escape them like so: <code>\\*</code>, <code>\\?</code>"
msgstr "啟用萬用字元後，可以使用 <code>?</code>（任意<b>一個</b>字元）和 <code>*</code>（零個或多個任意字元）進行尋找。如需尋找這些字元本身，請如此跳脫：<code>\\*</code>、<code>\\?</code>"

#: src/panel.ts
msgid "If you enable regular expressions, it's going to use JavaScript's regex. You can also use groups in the replacement text using <code>$1</code>, <code>$2</code>, and so on. Tip: Use regex101.com"
msgstr "啟用規則運算式後，將使用 JavaScript 的規則運算式。在取代文字中可以使用 <code>$1</code>、<code>$2</code> 等參照群組。提示：可以使用 regex101.com"

#: src/panel.ts
msgid "This plugin internally translates every search pattern to a regular expression. You can preview the used regex."
msgstr "本外掛程式會在內部將所有尋找模式轉換為規則運算式。您可以預覽實際使用的規則運算式。"

#: src/cmPlugin.ts
msgid "Empty pattern"
msgstr "尋找內容為空"

#: src/cmPlugin.ts
msgid "Please enter a search pattern."
msgstr "請輸入尋找內容。"

#: src/cmPlugin.ts
msgid "Invalid regular expression"
msgstr "無效的規則運算式"

#: src/cmPlugin.ts
msgid "No more occurences found"
msgstr "找不到更多相符項目"

#: src/cmPlugin.ts
#, c-format
msgid "\"%s\" couldn't be found."
msgstr "找不到「%s」。"

#: src/cmPlugin.ts
msgid "No occurences found"
msgstr "找不到相符項目"

#: src/cmPlugin.ts
#, c-format
msgid "\"%s\" couldn't be found. Nothing was replaced."
msgstr "找不到「%s」。未進行任何取代。"
